@using SteamAchievements.Preview.Fixtures

@* Development only. Cascaded into ApiKeyForm's hint slot by Routes.razor, so
   the rule sits under the field it governs on both screens that embed the form.
   Nothing like it ships: in the real host the outcome comes from Steam. *@
<div class="hint">
    <strong>Preview:</strong> the outcome is chosen by what you type —
    32 hexadecimal characters is accepted,
    <code>@FixtureOnboarding.RejectTrigger</code> is refused by Steam,
